some Processing\"\n    order: 2\n    description: \"This stage merges chunked data and processes SIFT scores at the individual chromosome level.\"\n    tasks:\n      - \"task:individuals_merge\"\n      - \"task:sifting\"\n\n  - stage_id: \"stage:analysis\"\n    name: \"Analysis\"\n    order: 3\n    description: \"This stage performs population-level mutation overlap and frequency analysis.\"\n    tasks:\n      - \"task:mutation_overlap\"\n      - \"task:frequency\"\n\ntasks:\n  - task_id: \"task:individuals\"\n    name: \"Individuals\"\n    stage: \"stage:preprocessing\"\n    executable: \"individuals\"\n    description: >\n      This task fetches and parses Phase3 genomic data from the 1000 Genomes Project\n      by chromosome. It identifies Single Nucleotide Polymorphism (SNP) variants\n      and which individuals possess them. The task processes a chunk of a chromosome's\n      VCF file and produces output files containing 'rs numbers' for individuals\n      with mutations on both alleles within that chunk.\n    behavioral_notes: >\n      Reads a subset of a large VCF file (chunked processing). Can be I/O bound\n      due to the size of the input data. Outputs compressed intermediate files\n      for each processed chunk.\n    parallelism_model:\n      type: \"embarrassingly_parallel\"\n      description: >\n        Multiple instances of this task run in parallel, each processing a distinct\n        line range (chunk) of the input VCF file for a given chromosome.\n    io_dominance: \"io_bound\"\n    io_access_type: \"python_serial\"\n    restart_model: \"idempotent\"\n    restart_checkpoint_dataset: null\n    hardware_path:\n      has_conditional_execution: true\n      execution_alternatives:\n        - path_id: \"default_path\"\n          condition: \"use_decaf=false, use_pmc=false\"\n          description: \"Standard execution path using the `bin/individuals` executable.\"\n          io_dominance_hint: \"io_bound\"\n        - path_id: \"decaf_path\"\n          